["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“无聊斋” × 罗永浩的X字路口！喜剧工作者在AI时代可以多“活”几年\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-cn2d7912-罗永浩判断-喜剧是ai最后才攻克的文本门类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e062d003e2512a09-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:30:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>罗永浩判断：喜剧是AI最后才攻克的文本门类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说自己问遍了几家顶级大模型，得到的共识是：脱口秀式一句一个梗的高密度喜剧文本，AI理论上能攻克，但注定排在最后，所以喜剧工作者比别的创作者能多活几年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">喜剧</span><span class=\"tag\">AI恐惧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年产1.4万辆，市值却超福特：卖的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年产仅1.4万辆，市值却超福特。秘诀在于同时拥有奢侈品的排他性和运动队的包容性，用稀缺性制造神话，用社群维持忠诚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然选择创始人Tristan聊，Elys、赛博分身、灵魂、Context的获取与流动和AI社交网络 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI时代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交网络要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 认为 AI 时代唯一重要的事是构建主体性——把 context 沉淀下来，让 AI 替你做社交里最无聊的商增，人只接管最重要的连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"崔健×罗永浩！去天堂和去地狱，都要带上艺术家 Trap Live House\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-02-cn2d7912-崔健-向资本妥协这一步-迈出去就再收不回来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1fdd6a22cb43a191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0402</span></div>\n<h2>崔健：向资本妥协这一步，迈出去就再收不回来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说音乐人一旦为了赚钱向市场让一步，社交、人脉、习惯就会全都被拖向那个方向、再也收不回头——这是他拒绝官方现场专辑、拒绝一比一复刻老歌的真正逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">摇滚乐</span><span class=\"tag\">AI与音乐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: The Man Behind NVIDIA (April 2026) CUDA tape out Innovator&#x27;s Dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-01-ch-how-i-built-this-and-guy-raz-黄仁勋-若知道要吃多少苦-他绝不会重新创办英伟达/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e69d89d6c13301aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This and Guy Raz</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0401</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：若知道要吃多少苦，他绝不会重新创办英伟达</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说，如果重来一次要承受同样的屈辱与亏损，他不会再创业——但这不代表他后悔英伟达今天的样子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: NVIDIA - The $4 Trillion Company &amp; the AI Revolution | Lex Fridman Podcast #494 Amdahl&#x27;s law extreme co-design install base agentic scaling law HBM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-01-lex-黄仁勋称agi已实现-一个agent就能开公司赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a070975c1c32ca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:25:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lex Fridman</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0401</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋称AGI已实现：一个agent就能开公司赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋说「十亿美元公司」不必长久——一个agent做出的应用一夜爆红，几十亿人为它付50美分，几个月后倒掉，照样算数。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">CUDA生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"134. 【数据的综述】和谢晨聊，新时代的石油、历史、版图、数据金字塔、定价与Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d3e6746f1dd5fb6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套数据闭环，在机器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多数据，是因为它部署了最多自己的车，靠的是本体。但具身领域没有上百万台机器人，最多的数据必然来自仿真和人的第一视角，本体商当不成最好的大脑商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"杨笠×罗永浩！不想成为“靶心”，也无意成为“灯塔”\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-26-cn2d7912-杨笠爆红风波溯源-那年男演员几乎都在刻板调侃老婆女友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/156b41be41c646a8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0326</span></div>\n<h2>杨笠爆红风波溯源：那年男演员几乎都在刻板调侃老婆女友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2021年脱口秀舞台上，多数男演员调侃老婆女友全是陈词滥调，这是杨笠那次表演被骂得最凶、却也最被误读的真实背景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脱口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">网络舆论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"133. 对谢赛宁的7小时马拉松访谈：世界模型、逃出硅谷、AMI Labs、两次拒绝Ilya、杨立昆、李飞飞和42 research taste representation learning contrastive learning anti-fragile DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-16-zhangxiaojun-世界模型不是语言模型-谢赛宁说lm终将凋零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4818fadeef8d1188-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">6:45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是语言模型：谢赛宁说LM终将凋零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谢赛宁认为语言模型是很好的工具，但不是通用智能的地基——它终将凋零。真正的地基是视觉与表征学习，这也是他离开硅谷、和杨立昆创立AMI的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">表征学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"戏剧导演孟京辉×罗永浩！从“爱惹事的反叛者”，到戏剧乌托邦的建构者 Theatre of the Absurd Stanislavski system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-05-cn2d7912-先锋戏剧票房悖论-越先锋-观众反而越多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/11d3f2d6cb063d7a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:20:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0305</span></div>\n<h2>先锋戏剧票房悖论：越先锋，观众反而越多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他不靠专家评审或打广告，直接把先锋戏剧讲给年轻观众听，三十年过去这些戏没有冷场，《恋爱的犀牛》甚至演到了第十一代演员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">先锋戏剧</span><span class=\"tag\">内容创作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“不开玩笑” × 罗永浩的X字路口！折腾未必会赢，但不折腾一定会后悔 ADHD 专注达\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-28-cn2d7912-罗永浩-人应该终生不退休-财富自由的朋友99-撑不过半年就复出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5d4d85d51d7f33f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:23:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0228</span></div>\n<h2>罗永浩：人应该终生不退休，财富自由的朋友99%撑不过半年就复出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说这个判断不是空想，而是观察移动互联网十年里，身边一大批实现财富自由、发誓要躺平的朋友，几乎全都撑不过三到六个月又出来折腾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗永浩</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP2 曾燕红：从中学老师到打破速登珠峰世界纪录，我唯一不能做的就是放弃 PTSD Free Solo Aim High, Achieve High\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-27-xiaotianzhang-离破纪录仅剩90米-她却选择带队原路撤退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d38949a273cb9e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0227</span></div>\n<h2>离破纪录仅剩90米，她却选择带队原路撤退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整个团队已经把消息传了出去，只剩90米就能刷新珠峰速攀世界纪录，Ada却和夏尔巴一起决定下撤——理由是哪怕只有百分之一的风险，她都不愿意冒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">珠峰速攀</span><span class=\"tag\">风险决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代码比交人更可能合作，但协调极难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡让双方互读源代码，用 Löb 定理实现合作；但合作依赖几乎相同的代码或共享随机数，现实中协调成本极高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>给 AI 产权，是为了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 拥有产权，它们就更不愿意破坏产权制度本身——包括抢走人类全部财产。这不是道德关怀，是风险对冲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">产权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"132. 对星海图创始人高继扬的3小时访谈：鲶鱼、曾国藩、Waymo与Momenta的两面、一只狼与许华哲的离开 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>机器人行业不浪漫：链条太长，人得把头伸到土里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海图创始人高继扬说，机器人创业的竞争是六边形：整机、供应链、数据、模型、渠道、终端，算法传播周期只有两三个月，壁垒最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"音乐人张玮玮×罗永浩！我们都是那个“混乱又伟大”的 90 年代的幸存者 after party\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-11-cn2d7912-舒适环境里创作不出东西-冲突和差异越大反而越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0980c89abd69e75d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:39:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0211</span></div>\n<h2>舒适环境里创作不出东西，冲突和差异越大反而越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民谣乐手张玮玮回顾从西北厂矿小城到北京地下室排练的十几年：父母离婚、国企崩塌、广州挨饿卖唱、乐队解散，每一次动荡都没把他压垮，反而是后来生活安稳下来才真正写不出东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民谣</span><span class=\"tag\">90年代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"蒋奇明&amp;双雪涛×罗永浩！如何成为飞行家 Peaky Blinders\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-04-cn2d7912-看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后-罗永浩的悲观被打消了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8991b069d150d3a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后，罗永浩的悲观被打消了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这两年大环境常让罗永浩悲观，但去深圳看了一圈20岁出头的硬件创业者、看到已经打出来的样机后，他相信扎实的工业基础能托住下一代，重新乐观起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东北文艺复兴</span><span class=\"tag\">电影改编</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: Founder and CEO of NVIDIA vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-a-bit-personal-with-jodi-shelton-黄仁勋-nvidia-没有终局计划-活下去就是全部战略/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/862453475cf2ed80-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">A Bit Personal with Jodi Shelton</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：NVIDIA 没有终局计划，活下去就是全部战略</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋说公司从没有过终局方案，「staying in business」才是唯一的计划；而他自己最珍视的不是智商而是「character」——这是面试测不出来、只能靠公司在痛苦中锻造出来的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"tag\">领导力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Factory: Infrastructure for Intelligence | Jensen Huang, CEO, NVIDIA AI factory agentic AI self-supervised learning physical AI TAM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-cisco-黄仁勋-你不愿公开的问题-才是公司最值钱的知识产权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5ea8055a378435f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cisco</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：你不愿公开的问题，才是公司最值钱的知识产权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达把自己的对话系统留在本地，不是因为答案敏感，而是因为「我在问什么」比「AI给了什么答案」更有价值——这条逻辑被他用来反对「全部上云」的默认选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI战略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"FULL CONVERSATION: Elon Musk Reveals AI, Space &amp; Robotics Plans to Secure Humanity’s Future | AQ1B Starship Optimus full self-driving (FSD)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-drm-news-马斯克-今年芯片产能就会超过电力供应-瓶颈是电不是芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd0549cbbd71aefb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">32:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">DRM News</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：今年芯片产能就会超过电力供应，瓶颈是电不是芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克称AI芯片产量正在指数级增长，而美国电网扩容每年只有4%到10%，今年或最迟明年芯片产能就会追上甚至超过能通电的上限。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI算力</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"LIVE: Elon Musk in Conversation with Larry Fink at Davos World Economic Forum | AI1G\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-drm-news-马斯克-太阳能将让空间成为建ai数据中心最便宜的地方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c356733fd484889-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">DRM News</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：太阳能将让空间成为建AI数据中心最便宜的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克预测今年AI就可能超越单个人类智力，而限制AI扩张的瓶颈不是芯片而是电力，这也是他押注太空太阳能数据中心的根本原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力瓶颈</span><span class=\"tag\">太空数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk – &quot;In 36 months, the cheapest place to put AI will be space” mass driver Kardashev scale reticle autoclave sim-to-real gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-dwarkesh-patel-and-2-more-马斯克断言-三年内把ai算力送上太空会比在地球发电更便宜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51a4d508f3ecbd54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh Patel and 2 more</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克断言：三年内把AI算力送上太空会比在地球发电更便宜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的论证是：地球电力产出基本停滞，而太空光伏不受大气和昼夜影响，发电效率提升五倍，还省掉电池，综合成本只有地面的十分之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空算力</span><span class=\"tag\">能源瓶颈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk Joins Panel Discussion at WEF | AC1P full reusability Optimus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-news-central-马斯克预测今年ai将比任何人都聪明-2031年超越全人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db9c6609a1ff9232-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">News Central</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克预测今年AI将比任何人都聪明，2031年超越全人类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克把太阳能、全复用火箭和人形机器人连成一条逻辑：电力是AI部署的真正瓶颈，而成本最低的AI数据中心最终会建在太空里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太阳能</span><span class=\"tag\">太空发射</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"CEO Fireside Chat With Jensen Huang and Pascal Daloz at Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE World world model Physics Nemo MBSE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-nvidia-英伟达与达索的25年合作-从opengl到ai世界模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31f8b10218ccd6f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NVIDIA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达与达索的25年合作：从OpenGL到AI世界模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋认为下一代设计工具不再靠人写结构化几何数据，而是靠AI理解物理法则和因果关系的「世界模型」，这是比语言模型更难的一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数字孪生</span><span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span>\n</div></div></a>"]